ps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1f/Font_TeamMeat_g.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060550\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"e\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat e.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_e.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/8a/Font_TeamMeat_e.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060501\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"r\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat r.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_r.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1e/Font_TeamMeat_r.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822061013\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"105\" height=\"123\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Bombgagger.png\" data-image-key=\"Bombgagger.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/53/Bombgagger.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824124437\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">26</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>844.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\"><img alt=\"Stage Ashpit icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Ashpit icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Ashpit_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cf/Stage_Ashpit_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172340\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Bombgaggers</b> are monsters added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Repentance\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Repentance\">The Binding of Isaac: Repentance</a></i> DLC and are exclusively found in <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\"><img alt=\"Ashpit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Ashpit icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Ashpit_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cf/Stage_Ashpit_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172340\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\">Ashpit</a>.\n</p><p>When near Isaac, they will begin to vomit up a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bombs#Giga_Bomb\" title=\"Bombs\"><img alt=\"Giga Bomb\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Giga Bomb.png\" data-image-key=\"Giga_Bomb.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/eb/Giga_Bomb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210824102710\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bombs#Giga_Bomb\" title=\"Bombs\">Giga Bomb</a> and proceed to run to a safe distance. Will spawn a Giga Bomb if killed during the vomiting animation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"t/tooltip&#124;Safety+Scissors&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Safety_Scissors\" title=\"Safety Scissors\"><img alt=\"Safety Scissors\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trinket Safety Scissors icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trinket_Safety_Scissors_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/16/Trinket_Safety_Scissors_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825035115\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Safety_Scissors\" title=\"Safety Scissors\">Safety Scissors</a></span> can be used to defuse and pick up the Giga Bombs that Bombgaggers produce.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Referred to as Toothman by the development team before Repentance's release.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In-game_Footage\">In-game Footage</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb embedvideo autoResize\" style=\"width: 408px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo autoResize\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideowrap\" style=\"width: 400px;\">\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<iframe title=\"Play video\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/DJutOKhHiII?start=48\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" style=\"border: none;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><img alt=\"MainPageAchievements\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazylo